-- src:14544 | (d) is made by a specified date.
@ref s 1035 s 446A(3) General powers to give directions (src:14540-14544)
GIVEN `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 includes the inspector's views on a specified matter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 does not include any reference to a specified matter` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 is made in a specified form or manner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 is made by a specified date` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1035 s 446A(3) the Secretary of State may give any inspector the direction` MEANS
    IF     `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 includes the inspector's views on a specified matter`
       OR  `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 does not include any reference to a specified matter`
       OR  `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 is made in a specified form or manner`
       OR  `the direction requires the inspector to secure that a specified report under section 437 is made by a specified date`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a direction requiring him to secure that a specified report under section 437— (a) includes ... (d) is made by a specified date"; another direction is not mentioned

